RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "Hold it. ROCKET left this lift to\n"
    .string "rot. ONYBRIS keeps it running.$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "Oww!\n"
    .string "Beaten!$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "ROCKET vanished years ago and left\n"
    .string "the whole base behind.\p"
    .string "ONYBRIS moved in, scrubbed three\n"
    .string "rooms blue, and called it a bank.\p"
    .string "Our boss never calls. Orders just\n"
    .string "appear in our heads. Creepy, huh?$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "A customer in the new reception?\n"
    .string "Management does not allow that.$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "Boom!$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "ONYBRIS paid for the paint. The\n"
    .string "rest of the floor is still ROCKET's\l"
    .string "old mess. Watch your step.\p"
    .string "This branch pays for the whole\n"
    .string "network. Touch it and you answer\l"
    .string "to VESPER.$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt3Intro::
    .string "Intruder alert!$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt3Defeat::
    .string "I can't do it!$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle::
    .string "ROCKET left crates of junk down\n"
    .string "here. We sell whatever we find.\p"
    .string "Rusty, dusty... but the cash\n"
    .string "spends just the same.$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt4Intro::
    .string "Why did you come here?$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt4Defeat::
    .string "This won't do!$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt4PostBattle::
    .string "Okay, I'll talk...\n"
    .string "These were ROCKET's bunks. Nobody\l"
    .string "cleaned them. Nobody dares.\p"
    .string "Take the elevator to see VESPER.\n"
    .string "But the LIFT KEY went missing.\l"
    .string "Ask the guards on the lower floors.$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt5Intro::
    .string "Are you lost, you little mouse?\n"
    .string "The old bunks are off limits!$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt5Defeat::
    .string "Why…?$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Grunt5PostBattle::
    .string "Uh-oh, that ruckus somehow opened\n"
    .string "the door!$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Entry1::
    .string "Fresh blue paint, new lights, a new\n"
    .string "desk. But under the paint, a faded\l"
    .string "red R still shows through.\p"
    .string "$"

RocketHideout_B1F_Text_Entry2::
    .string "ROCKET abandoned this base long\n"
    .string "ago. Now somebody has taken it\l"
    .string "back, one blue room at a time.$"

